    "detailed_description": "JumpCubox is a physics-based 2.5D platformer.<br />\r\nRoll and jump your cube through harsh traps in order to reach the goal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have 30 levels to complete, collecting coins as you go!<br />\r\nThere are 3 coins in each level.<br />\r\n\u30fbLevel clear: Reach the goal safely!<br />\r\n\u30fbCoins: Find the coins and get them!<br />\r\n\u30fbTime Attack: Try to complete each level within the time set for it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can also wall jump, climb up hills, touch switches to open doors, and clear various other gimmicks!",
